        {
          "id": 2623426307,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This had an unintended effect - if lookup succeeds in the generic file for one port type, the lookup won't be repeated later for the same port number but a different port type. E.g., if you have port 443 on both TCP and UDP, only the first resolution will succeed. Unfortunately it was cherry-picked back to 4.4 before this was noticed.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
